{"slug":"MilkyWay","title":"MilkyWay","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Details","text":"Details","level":2}],"html":"<p><b>MilkyWay</b> is a cosmic map in <a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" title=\"OpenFront\">OpenFront</a>.</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/MilkyWay_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"640\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"1750\" data-file-height=\"1750\"><figcaption>The MilkyWay map, from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/milkyway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Nations\">Nations</h2></div>\n<p>The map features 6 named <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a>, including Sagittarius A*, Perseus Arm, Centaurus Arm, Empire of Mankind, Aliens and The Void.</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Details\">Details</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Categories:</b> Cosmic</li>\n<li><b>Nations:</b> 6</li>\n<li><b>Public rotation frequency:</b> 8</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Maps</a></li></ul>","section":"Maps"}
